WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.739 --> 00:00:09.089
CEOs can add managers to their organisation. This tutorial uses fictional

2
00:00:09.089 --> 00:00:10.742
demonstration data.

3
00:00:11.203 --> 00:00:14.627
Open Users and select the Managers tab.

4
00:00:15.086 --> 00:00:21.450
Select New manager. You can also choose Add manager from your account menu.

5
00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.709
Enter their first and last name.

6
00:00:25.379 --> 00:00:30.513
Keep Internal manager as the manager type, and add a job title.

7
00:00:30.973 --> 00:00:37.052
Add their work email and mobile number. The invitation is sent to this email

8
00:00:37.052 --> 00:00:37.692
address.

9
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:44.884
Select Create manager. Crewflow queues the invitation and opens their details.

10
00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:50.423
Their status shows the invitation until they set a password and sign in.
